    </div>
    <div class="content-split__content" style="background: var(--color-dark-pine);">
      <span class="content-split__eyebrow">The Process</span>
      <h2 class="content-split__heading">How the Program Works</h2>
      <p class="content-split__text">Students participate in a structured program where they learn about philanthropy, assess community needs, and evaluate grant applications from local nonprofits. The program culminates in student-led grant decisions.</p>
      <ul class="content-split__list">
        <li>Students learn about grantmaking and community leadership</li>
        <li>Youth review real applications from local nonprofits</li>
        <li>Classroom discussions build consensus on funding priorities</li>
        <li>Students award grants and present to recipient organizations</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

